# Lab Sheet 2: Task 4 - Redis Key-Value Student Information System

# 1. Store student ID as the key and student name as the value (Insert at least 5 students)
SET student:101 "Asha Sharma"
SET student:102 "Ravi Kumar"
SET student:103 "Pooja Verma"
SET student:104 "Amit Singh"
SET student:105 "Neha Patel"

# 2. Retrieve a student using the key
GET student:101

# 3. Update a student's value
SET student:102 "Ravi K. Verma"
GET student:102

# 4. Delete a student
DEL student:105

# 5. Display all available keys
KEYS student:*
